WEBVTT

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:45.520
I've got to hold back.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:50.360
Oh, Miss Yoshinoya, you haven't gone to lunch yet?

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.610
Mr. Mashiko...

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:54.930
They still have fried chicken bowls.

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:56.240
I know.

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:00.740
But it's the first week of the new semester. I have to try my hardest.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:14.010
Healthy diet, healthy mind.

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:17.790
Avoiding meals for a pointless diet not only

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:24.430
weakens one's physical and mental vigor, but also harms one's health.

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:35.830
Those still maturing should eat well, study hard, and exercise often.

00:01:42.930 --> 00:01:46.360
I'll use that at the morning assembly next week.

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:19.070
One, two, three, four!

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:21.160
Two, two, three, four!

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:22.770
Miya!

00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:24.340
Morning, Yunocchi!

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:27.120
Good morning. Aren't you cold in that?

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:30.130
Nah, it's warm today.

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:34.390
Sorry I'm late.

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:37.460
I set my alarm, but it didn't go off.

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:41.260
It's okay. I just started, myself.

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:45.510
I was so hungry that I woke up before mine.

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:49.100
We have our physical exams today, right?

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:50.350
Yeah.

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:52.230
All right, I'll try my hardest!

00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:54.360
Try your hardest at what?

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:57.940
Stretching myself out a little more.

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:01.200
Yuno, Miyako, good morning.

00:03:02.190 --> 00:03:03.090
Morning.

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:04.890
Good morning, Nori.

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:06.840
You joining in?

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:09.670
Yeah, I even changed into a track suit.

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:11.050
Mind moving over a little?

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:12.960
Sure, go ahead.

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:17.540
One, two, three, four!

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:19.800
Two, two, three, four!

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:22.470
Three, two, three, four!

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:24.880
It's like we're in grade school again.

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:28.180
Working out really feels good.

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:28.930
Yeah!

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:31.990
Makes me feel like working hard today.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:56.080
You can go ahead and have some.

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:59.420
But we have physical exams today.

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:02.340
It doesn't count if you're trying to cheat.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:06.200
I guess, but I'm still worried about it.

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:08.640
If even you're worried...

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:12.020
That means...

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:25.080
Hiro! Hold on!

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:28.210
Sorry, Yuno.

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:31.900
I haven't eaten anything since lunch yesterday.

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:33.870
I'll take care of this.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:35.410
Sae?

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:45.230
Sae! That's so sweet!

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:50.140
Miya, we need to get going.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:53.560
Yeah. Sae, Hiro, we're off.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.640
Okay, see you later.

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:58.060
Bye.

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:04.940
Hey, Miya, why don't they check shoe sizes during the physical?

00:05:07.130 --> 00:05:09.450
22.5...

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:12.150
I guess it'd be too much of a pain.

00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:13.870
I guess.

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:19.710
My vision's gotten worse.

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:22.290
Welcome back!

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:26.100
Thanks. You guys heading over now?

00:05:26.100 --> 00:05:27.050
Yeah.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:30.680
Nazuna, are you happy about something?

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:33.310
How could you tell?

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:36.640
Well, I got a little taller.

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:40.690
Two millimeters.

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:42.440
Within the margin of error...

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:49.950
Yunocchi, how tall were you last year?

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:54.580
144.5. I wonder how much I've grown.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.200
Okay, next.

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:00.390
Stretch out as much as you can without raising your chin.

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:01.210
Okay.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:06.170
Let's see...

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:10.130
144.3cm.

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:14.050
That... That has to be an error!

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:18.770
Good morning. Are you done with your physicals already?

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.890
Morning! We're done.

00:06:20.890 --> 00:06:21.900
Good morning!

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:23.150
Good morning!

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:29.280
You're worried about your weight, aren't you?

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:31.780
You're not overweight at all, so don't worry.

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:33.660
How could you tell?

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:36.270
By how you hold your results sheet.

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:40.340
Girls who try to hide it after they're weighed usually are.

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:45.710
Last year, there was a second year girl who
folded it over as many times as she could.

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:48.110
That had to have been Hiro.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:54.190
Okay, next.

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:55.850
Cover your right eye.

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:58.600
Okay, what's this one?

00:06:58.600 --> 00:06:59.800
Right.

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:00.500
Correct.

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:01.860
Up?

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:03.430
Correct. This one?

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:04.930
Right.

00:07:04.930 --> 00:07:05.550
How about this?

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:06.540
Right.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:08.860
Miya!?

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:15.950
Using only this stick, I will perform three impressions!

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:19.620
A pirate!

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:22.120
Yagyu Jubei!

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:24.120
Masamune the One-Eyed Dragon!

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:27.250
They all look the same, Miya.

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:33.880
Nothing's changed at all since last year.

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:38.010
That's not true, Yuno!

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:40.390
Miss Yoshinoya!

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:43.140
You've gotten a little bigger.

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:45.440
Right here.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:52.690
I don't think I've gotten much bigger.

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:54.950
Sexual harassment again, Miss Yoshinoya?

00:07:58.530 --> 00:08:01.540
It's over! Let's go home.

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:04.460
Yeah. That sure took a while.

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:06.670
They had to do all the students.

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:10.420
I wonder if Hiro made it.

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:20.600
There you go.

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:22.850
That's great!

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:26.810
I tried.

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:32.190
You mean your weight went down?

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:33.170
Yeah.

00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:37.160
Were you on a diet?

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:38.860
For one day.

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:41.160
It must've worked.

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:44.710
But if you eat like this, it'll just go back up.

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:49.460
Well, that may be, but for now...

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:54.970
I've already set my official record for the year.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:09:00.290
Nori, don't pick on her today.

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:01.810
Uh, right.

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:08.760
I feel so relaxed.

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:13.320
You always look so happy enjoying a good meal, Yunocchi.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.930
So do you, Miyako.

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:17.200
I guess so.

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:20.410
This is even better than what you get from the store.

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:22.260
I'm surprised.

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:22.950
Yeah.

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:25.200
I'm having one of these too.

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:30.710
It's great.

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:34.960
Arisawa?

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:38.300
Hello? What's up?

00:09:39.340 --> 00:09:41.030
The wrong number?

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.970
Yeah, I'm doing good.

00:09:43.990 --> 00:09:45.830
Not at all.

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:48.530
It surprised me a little, but I'm glad.

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:49.940
Okay, talk to you later.

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:52.860
She had the wrong number.

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:54.320
Arisawa?

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:55.750
Um...

00:09:56.570 --> 00:10:01.700
Oh, last winter, when I left my phone in the art room...

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:05.160
She's the one who found your phone?

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:09.460
Yeah, but she was in a hurry and dialed the wrong number.

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:11.710
Oh, so that's why.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:14.910
Yuno, you lost your phone?

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:20.630
Yeah, last winter I forgot and left it in the art room.

00:10:20.630 --> 00:10:23.230
I never forget mine.

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:27.710
It has a lot of personal info on it, so it'd be bad to lose it.

00:10:28.860 --> 00:10:33.230
I've forgotten mine at a friend's place.

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:38.630
She didn't realize either. It was surprising.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:41.740
It's good that it was at a friend's.

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:42.520
Yeah.

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:48.480
Sorry I'm taking so long to eat.

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:50.500
Don't worry. Take your time.

00:10:51.470 --> 00:10:52.440
Okay.

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:58.000
January 31st

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:58.000
Straightforward
Words

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:05.260
I took this at school today in the corner of the courtyard.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:07.820
Wow, they're round!

00:11:07.820 --> 00:11:11.270
They're doves. When it gets cold, they scrunch their necks up.

00:11:11.640 --> 00:11:13.350
Cute!

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:14.770
Oh, that's right!

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:21.840
I took some neat pictures yesterday.

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:22.990
The doggie...

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:25.910
The doggie...

00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:28.540
The doggie...

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:30.620
The doggie...

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:32.370
The doggie what!?

00:11:34.370 --> 00:11:38.590
Sorry, I don't remember where I put my phone.

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:41.970
I'll call it. Hold on.

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:46.600
I've got it set to vibrate, so it won't ring.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:51.100
Don't worry. If we're quiet, we'll hear it buzz.

00:11:58.100 --> 00:11:59.360
Hello?

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:01.730
Someone answered!

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:03.860
Yuno!

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:06.500
Okay!

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.410
Um, hello?

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:09.500
Hello?

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:13.580
Sorry, that's my phone.

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:17.880
Oh, really? That's good to hear.

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:20.440
What a beautiful voice.

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:24.590
Where are you now?

00:12:26.120 --> 00:12:27.590
In the art room?

00:12:27.590 --> 00:12:28.720
Okay.

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:32.810
Okay, I'll be right there.

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:35.540
Thank you.

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:40.680
In the art room? You forgot it at school?

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:43.320
Yeah. I'm going right over.

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:46.700
I'm glad it's okay.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:52.660
But my phone must be so cold and nervous that it's shivering.

00:12:53.350 --> 00:12:55.040
Cold and nervous?

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:07.300
Brrrrrr...

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:11.890
There's a light on.

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:17.060
Excuse me.

00:13:38.690 --> 00:13:40.130
Are you okay?

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:43.340
I'm not sure.

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:48.340
You're Yuno, right?

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:50.890
I'm Arisawa, a third year.

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:51.850
Pleased to meet you.

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:53.850
A third year...

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:56.270
Here's your phone.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:58.060
Thank you!

00:13:58.590 --> 00:14:02.460
It scared me a little when it started buzzing all of a sudden.

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:03.520
Sorry.

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:06.690
My heart skipped a beat.

00:14:06.690 --> 00:14:08.570
I'm sorry.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:20.500
Are you here this late drawing every day?

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:25.550
Third years get to stay late around this point in the semester, right?

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:33.010
Yeah. I really should be at the lab, but I hate feeling so tingly, so I'm slacking.

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:36.260
Lab? Tingly?

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:41.900
Electricity? Or maybe hydrochloric acid?

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:45.940
By lab, I meant my cram school.

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:51.030
Sometimes we call art cram schools labs.

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:57.410
We're studying hard right before exams, so the atmosphere's really tense.

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:03.170
Hey, let me draw you!

00:15:04.580 --> 00:15:07.470
It'll be a change of pace.

00:15:07.470 --> 00:15:08.310
Please!

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:11.880
Sure.

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:16.640
All right, strip!

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:20.890
Responsible for the 2nd Art Prep Room
Yoshinoya • Mashiko

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:36.260
Sorry, it's an in-joke in my class.

00:15:38.490 --> 00:15:40.910
You don't have to be so stiff.

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:49.590
You came really fast after you called. Do you live around here?

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:52.840
Yeah, I live at the apartments
right in front of the school.

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:56.140
At Hidamari Apartments?

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:57.080
Yeah.

00:15:58.390 --> 00:16:00.810
So, you're from the trickster's place?

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:04.310
I guess some people call it that.

00:16:05.990 --> 00:16:08.840
Is the lab far away?

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:13.560
Not really. It's by the next station.

00:16:13.560 --> 00:16:16.580
But I always end up getting home late.

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:18.330
How late?

00:16:19.030 --> 00:16:21.580
I'm almost never home before 9:00.

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:28.330
Are you trying for an art college?

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:33.340
I think I probably will.

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:40.640
What are you going to major in?

00:16:43.720 --> 00:16:44.850
I haven't decided.

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:50.610
Last fall, I went to check out an open campus.

00:16:53.980 --> 00:16:56.470
It was overwhelming.

00:16:56.470 --> 00:16:59.000
We were only two or three years apart,

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:03.620
but their materials and techniques were completely different.

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:07.390
They looked so cool! They shone!

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:16.440
At that moment, I thought, "I want to go here. I want to nurture my talent here."

00:17:20.950 --> 00:17:21.850
I'm done.

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:26.820
It's a bit rough, but would you like to take a look?

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:27.600
Sure!

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:45.370
It's so well done! And not only that, but it also feels so warm.

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:47.330
It's wonderful.

00:17:53.950 --> 00:17:57.030
Sorry I'm getting so conceited about it.

00:17:58.320 --> 00:18:00.510
I'm not angry.

00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:08.370
Sorry to keep you here so late.

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:10.650
It's fine. I had fun.

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:15.500
Me too. It's been a while since I enjoyed drawing that much.

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:16.480
Thanks.

00:18:18.520 --> 00:18:19.650
Later.

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:22.910
Um...

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:27.920
I hope you do well on your exams!

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:35.100
See you.

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:53.980
My phone?

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:55.480
It's Sae.

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:57.550
Hello?

00:18:57.550 --> 00:18:59.400
Hi, Yuno?

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:02.740
Oh, good. It's getting late, so I was worried.

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:03.990
Where are you now?

00:19:07.390 --> 00:19:09.910
Right in front of the trickster's apartments.

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:12.550
Where's that?

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:16.100
She hung up.

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:18.090
She must be at school.

00:19:21.210 --> 00:19:22.930
Hello?

00:19:24.650 --> 00:19:25.930
I'm back.

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:29.220
Sorry to worry you.

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:30.370
Welcome back.

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:33.060
Welcome back, Yunocchi and Yunocchi's phone!

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:37.730
Welcome back. I'm glad you found your phone.

00:19:38.140 --> 00:19:38.980
Yeah.

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:42.490
Hold on a second.

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:53.000
Tadah!

00:19:55.270 --> 00:19:58.000
Huh? What about the doggie?

00:19:58.560 --> 00:20:00.250
What are you talking about?

00:20:12.780 --> 00:20:15.810
I'm glad I found my phone.

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:25.990
Arisawa is such a nice person.

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:28.940
I wonder if we'll meet again.

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:35.430
I hope I get into an art college.

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:44.520
I was just at the convenience store, and the clerk grabbed my hand! What's up with that?

00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:46.060
When you got your change?

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:47.880
It sounds so suspenseful!

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:49.500
So, which hand do you use?

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:52.220
I've had them grab both my hands before.

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:56.120
That must feel great when it's cold.

00:20:57.280 --> 00:21:01.600
Next time, "October 13th: The Lofty Sky, the Shady Trees" and

00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:05.600
"April 26th~27th: Experienced in Love."

00:21:05.600 --> 00:21:09.220
We'll be waiting at Yamabuki High. Be sure to come see us!
